## contract line
24:Port contract suites state what every implementation of a port must do, in `packages/adapters/test/contract/` (`processContract`, `gitContract`, `runnerContract`, `remoteContract`). `packages/adapters/test/integration/contract/contract.test.ts` runs them against the real adapters offline: real processes (a real zombie included), real git repos, the headless runner, gh and glab over scripted CLI
74:## Where the contracts live
80:Change a contract only together with its tests and every user of it.
